Agreement between the City of Cheyenne and the Cheyenne Animal Shelter/Services for
Animal Shelter Services.  Rick Collard, Executive Director, Cheyenne Animal Shelter, stated the
Animal Shelter Board of Directors were aware of and are willing to accept the same 12.2%
funding cut made to other City departments and agencies due to the economic situation. Mr.
Valdez moved to approve, seconded by Mr. Spiker. Mr. Valdez moved to postpone to Oct. 25,
2010, seconded by Mr. Spiker.  It was clarified the reason for the postponement was because
there was no representative present to discuss the item at Finance Committee.  Upon inquiry, Mr.
Collard noted that use of funding from their Foundation may be utilized to supplement the
reduced funding level.  Motion to postpone failed.  Voting “no” – all members of the governing
body present.  Main motion carried.  Voting “yes” – all members of the governing body present.
(#5596)
