the Animal Shelter Board of Directors were aware of and are willing to accept the same 12.2%
funding cut made to other City departments and agencies due to the economic situation.  Mr.
Valdez moved to approve, seconded by Mr. Spiker.  Mr. Valdez moved to postpone to Oct. 25,
