Professional Services Agreement/Contract between City of Cheyenne, Parks &
Recreation Department and S&S Builders, Inc., for building improvements at the Pioneer Park
Center, 1331 Talbot Court, Cheyenne, WY (2007-2010 1% Optional Sales Tax and CDBG grant
funds).  Todd Feezer, Asst. Director, Parks and Recreation, explained the agreement/contract is
to provide repairs to extend the life of the facility and requested a proposed substitute be
approved as he inadvertently omitted Federal language in the initial document which is required
due to CDBG grant funds.  He further explained Federal requirements involving the Davis-
Bacon Act and amount of wages that must be paid for labor provided under the contract, and
stated this requirement increases the total amount of the agreement/contract by $2,495.00. Mr.
Valdez moved to approve in an amount not to exceed $77,380.00, seconded by Mr. Collins.  Mr.
Valdez moved to amend by substitute, seconded by Mr. Collins. Mayor Kaysen clarified the
amendment would include the additional $2,495.00 for a total amount of $79,875.00.  Motion to
amend carried.  Voting “yes” – all members of the governing body present.  Main motion as
amended by substitute carried.  Voting “yes” – all members of the governing body present.
(#5598)
